### Payment API Endpoints Tests
### These tests demonstrate the newly created/updated payment endpoints

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001
@token = your-jwt-token-here

### 1. POST /api/payments/create-intent
### Creates a payment intent for direct payment processing
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/create-intent
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "amount": 1999,
  "currency": "usd",
  "orderId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "metadata": {
    "server_plan": "Premium",
    "quantity": "1"
  }
}

### 2. POST /api/payments/confirm
### Confirms a payment intent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/confirm
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "paymentIntentId": "pi_xxxxxxxxxxxxx",
  "paymentMethodId": "pm_xxxxxxxxxxxxx"
}

### 3. POST /api/payments/webhook
### Webhook endpoint for Stripe callbacks (no auth required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: t=1234567890,v1=signature_hash_here

{
  "id": "evt_test_webhook",
  "object": "event",
  "type": "payment_intent.succeeded",
  "data": {
    "object": {
      "id": "pi_xxxxxxxxxxxxx",
      "amount": 1999,
      "currency": "usd",
      "status": "succeeded"
    }
  }
}

### 4. GET /api/payments/{id}
### Retrieves payment details by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
